{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05281","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得余字 · 萧至忠","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得余字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"望幸三秋暮，登高九日初。\n朱旗巡汉苑，翠帟俯秦墟。\n宠极萸房遍，恩深菊酎余。\n承欢何以荅，万亿奉宸居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧至忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}